      evolution: 'The game has remained a regional tradition in Catalonia. It uses the standard Spanish deck and follows traditional fishing game mechanics with local variations.',
      cultural: "Part of Catalan card game tradition. Played primarily by children. The name 'Cau Robat' reflects the game's mechanics (Cau = capture call, Robat = stolen).",
